parameters.help_en:
The data to write. The value is a JSON structure in the following fixed format:

```
{
    "key1": {
        "value":xxx1
        "time":yyy1
    },
    "key2": {
        "value":xxx2
        "time":yyy2
    }
}
```

key1 and key2 are field identifiers. Each Items can contain multiple fields.
value is the value of the field. Supported data types are int32, float, double, text, date, bool, enum, struct, and array. For more information, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/358843.html.
time: the UTC timestamp of the field value, in milliseconds

parameters.help_zh:
写入的数据，固定为如下JSON数据结构。

```
{
    "key1": {
        "value":xxx1
        "time":yyy1
    },
    "key2": {
        "value":xxx2
        "time":yyy2
    }
}
```

key1、key2为字段标识符，每个Items可包含多个字段。
value为字段对应的值，支持数据类型为int32、float、double、text、date、bool、enum、struct和array。详细说明，请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/358843.html。
time：字段值对应的UTC时间戳，单位为毫秒
